config PINCTRL_AM335X
	bool "TI AM335x pinctrl driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_AM335X_PINCTRL_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable pin control driver for TI AM335x SoC series.
	  This driver provides:
	  - Pin multiplexing (8 modes per pin)
	  - Pull-up/pull-down resistor control
	  - Input enable control
	  - Slew rate control

	  The driver allows configuration of the AM335x control
	  module registers to properly route signals to external
	  pins and configure electrical properties.